          <div ref="logEl" class="log-body" role="log" aria-label="AI 陪玩实时日志"><div v-if="!logEntries.length" class="log-empty"><span>✧</span><b>等待同伴上线</b><p>连接游戏并开始陪玩后，模型回复与每一步行动会显示在这里。</p></div><div v-for="entry in logEntries" :key="entry.id" class="log-line" :class="entry.kind"><time>{{new Date(entry.time).toLocaleTimeString('zh-CN',{hour12:false})}}</time><span class="log-kind">{{({system:'系统',model:'模型',tool:'工具',game:'游戏',user:'你',error:'错误'})[entry.kind]}}</span><pre>{{entry.text}}</pre></div></div>
